Package: pullthroughtestset
Type: Package
Title: Minimal Real R Build for the Pull-Through Proxy Test Set
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Declares one real CRAN dependency (R6). Installing the
    dependencies drives the proxy's CRAN backend: R fetches the
    src/contrib/PACKAGES index and then the R6 source tarball, which the
    backend verifies against the MD5sum the index records. Point R at the
    proxy with options(repos = c(CRAN = "https://proxy.example.com/v1/cran")).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    R6
